des":"Preserves intentional legacy-attribute assertions while allowing unrelated deprecation warnings elsewhere in the test class to remain visible."}],"consistency":[{"citations":[".github/instructions/java-style.instructions.md:33-38","instrumentation/armeria/armeria-grpc-1.14/javaagent/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/javaagent/instrumentation/armeria/grpc/v1_14/ArmeriaGrpcTest.java:65-96","instrumentation/sofa-rpc-5.4/testing/src/main/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/sofarpc/v5_4/AbstractSofaRpcTest.java:64-65"],"classification":"avoidable","explanation":"The class-level deprecation suppression is broader than necessary: all deprecated semconv references are confined to assertSpan. Narrowed it to that helper, matching the member-scoped suppression instruction and nearby RPC tests. The superclass's class-level suppression is not a counterexample because its deprecated constants are used by multiple test methods.","path":"instrumentation/sofa-rpc-5.4/library/src/test/java/io/opentelemetry/instrumentation/sofarpc/v5_4/TracingFilterTest.java"},{"citations":[".github/instructions/instrumentation-gradle.instructions.md:42-46",".github/instructions/instrumentation-gradle.instructions.md:55-68",".github/agents/knowledge/testing-semconv-stability.md:24-38",".github/agents/knowledge/gradle-conventions.md:467-474","instrumentation/grpc-1.6/library/build.gradle.kts:27-49"],"classification":"needed","explanation":"Using testPreviewSemconv and the preview property rather than nearby modules' legacy testStableSemconv/opt-in naming follows the current RPC selection convention. Both registered variants set testClassesDirs and classpath, inherit shared JVM settings, and participate in check. Default, preview-only, and rpc/dup coverage are preserved. No metadata properties are required because this module does not already configure collection.","path":"instrumentation/sofa-rpc-5.4/library/build.gradle.kts"},{"citations":["instrumentation-api-incubator/src/main/java/io/opentelem